WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.173 --> 00:00:05.839
- What's up, hey, how's it going?

00:00:05.839 --> 00:00:07.005
Are you free this weekend?

00:00:07.005 --> 00:00:08.271
Cause I got no friends,

00:00:08.271 --> 00:00:10.741
but I got some great plans ahead for us.

00:00:10.741 --> 00:00:11.730
Let's go.

00:00:11.730 --> 00:00:12.664
Brunch, okay, first of all,

00:00:12.664 --> 00:00:14.325
who doesn't love a good meal with friends?

00:00:14.325 --> 00:00:16.703
Plus, brunch means that
you can eat breakfast

00:00:16.703 --> 00:00:18.743
while still sleeping in.

00:00:18.743 --> 00:00:20.977
Plus, who doesn't love a
good mimosa, am I right?

00:00:20.977 --> 00:00:22.220
You know what?

00:00:22.220 --> 00:00:24.715
It's time to treat yourself!

00:00:24.715 --> 00:00:28.013
Go to the mall and buy a
nice outfit just for you.

00:00:28.013 --> 00:00:28.862
Why?

00:00:28.862 --> 00:00:30.033
Because you deserve it.

00:00:30.033 --> 00:00:31.850
Who says sleepovers are just for kids?

00:00:31.850 --> 00:00:33.015
Not me.

00:00:33.015 --> 00:00:34.336
Grab a couple of your closest friends,

00:00:34.336 --> 00:00:36.669
and have a fun night inside.

00:00:37.513 --> 00:00:38.845
Look at how much fun they're having!

00:00:38.845 --> 00:00:39.828
Look at them!

00:00:39.828 --> 00:00:42.092
Aw, look at them, they look so cute.

00:00:42.092 --> 00:00:44.408
I love to sing, even though I can't.

00:00:44.408 --> 00:00:46.266
But it doesn't matter,
because you can go out

00:00:46.266 --> 00:00:48.528
and sing with other people
who are bad at singing,

00:00:48.528 --> 00:00:50.010
and everybody wins.

00:00:50.010 --> 00:00:52.356
Feeling a little bit
adventurous this weekend?

00:00:52.356 --> 00:00:54.323
Hiking can be the perfect trip for you,

00:00:54.323 --> 00:00:57.012
especially after a long, stressful week.

00:00:57.012 --> 00:00:58.367
Think about all the cool Instagram photos

00:00:58.367 --> 00:01:00.265
that you can take with nature.

00:01:00.265 --> 00:01:01.328
So, there we go.

00:01:01.328 --> 00:01:03.566
All of our plans for the weekend are set.

00:01:03.566 --> 00:01:05.823
We're gonna hang out,
we're gonna hang out!

00:01:05.823 --> 00:01:06.656
Let's go.

00:01:06.656 --> 00:01:08.271
I'm dancing, I'm dancing, I'm dancing,

00:01:08.271 --> 00:01:10.354
I'll pick you up, see ya.

